sequenceDiagram
    participant OP as Operator
    participant ED as Editor
    participant IN as Integrator

    Note over OP, IN: Phase 1: Qualification
    OP->>IN: Submit RFC/Defect (full data, logs)
    IN->>IN: Triage & Assign (to sub-pilar)
    
    Note over OP, IN: Phase 2: Analyse & Solution
    IN->>ED: Functional & Technical Analysis
    ED-->>OP: Effort Estimation & Proposal
    
    Note over OP, IN: Phase 3: Priorisation
    Note over OP, IN: Decision Gate (Reject / Refuse / Accept)
    OP->>OP: Manco OI Decision
    
    Note over OP, IN: Phase 4: Build
    OP->>ED: Execute Decision (Release / Hotfix)
    ED->>ED: Code Review & Functional Review
    
    Note over OP, IN: Phase 5: Final Validation & Delivery
    ED->>OP: Deliver in Acceptance
    OP->>OP: Owner Validation
    OP->>IN: Deliver in Production
    IN->>OP: Solution Confirmed (Solved)
